# 20. Error Handling Strategy

## AI Failure

* Retry request.
* Display user-friendly error.

## Sandbox Failure

* Restart sandbox automatically.
* Notify user.

## Network Failure

* Retry SSE connection.
* Reconnect automatically.

## Database Failure

* Retry operation.
* Log failure event.

## File Write Failure

* Rollback changes.
* Display error notification.

